{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-forsaken/1478085-random-auspices","id":1478085,"title":"Random auspices","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Werewolf: The Forsaken"],"posts":[{"date":"2022-04-05T12:57:10-07:00","id":1478085,"title":"Random auspices","content":"I played a lot forsaken, basically is my most played game along with apocalypse. But I always have some doubts about a single thing.<br /> How much random are the auspices when a werewolf goes through the first change ? <br /> The books talk about personality before the change. But also, about Luna's madness and randomness of the auspice. <br /> <br /> How much your personality can have an influence on the first change? Or is it total random , despite your attitude ?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"color:#800000\">-'' </span>We are the unsullied.<br /> We are the inheritors.<br /> We are the Pure <span style=\"color:#800000\">''-</span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3773-helur","name":"Helur","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3773_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"352"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-04-05T15:17:36-07:00","id":1478096,"title":"","content":"Yes.<br /> <br /> IME the game works best when every option on the spectrum of &quot;determined by personality&quot; to, &quot;that wacky old Luna doing a thing,&quot; show up. It helps keep the setting mysterious, and adds variety to characters and their reaction to their Auspice. If you never really know how much was personality, and how much was randomness, where your Auspice fits, and where it seems strange for your nature, gets to be a compelling personal journey. If you know it's random, you know it's just luck when it fits and when it doesn't. If you know it's about you being the right kind of person for the Auspice, you're stuck on the single story of how your individual quirks are really secretly good things for your role. Uncertainty means options.<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/617-heavy-arms","name":"Heavy Arms","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar617_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"12634"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-04-05T23:45:58-07:00","id":1478121,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Heavy Arms</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-forsaken/1478085-random-auspices?p=1478096#post1478096\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Yes.<br /> <br /> IME the game works best when every option on the spectrum of &quot;determined by personality&quot; to, &quot;that wacky old Luna doing a thing,&quot; show up. It helps keep the setting mysterious, and adds variety to characters and their reaction to their Auspice. If you never really know how much was personality, and how much was randomness, where your Auspice fits, and where it seems strange for your nature, gets to be a compelling personal journey. If you know it's random, you know it's just luck when it fits and when it doesn't. If you know it's about you being the right kind of person for the Auspice, you're stuck on the single story of how your individual quirks are really secretly good things for your role. Uncertainty means options.</div> </div> </div> </div>So there is no &quot;official&quot; option about it? <br /> My questions came up when I read again wtf2. On every auspice chapter there is a little insight on how was that person before the change , the rahu almost always dominant and confrontational, the cahalith a passionate one and so on. But at the end of the book there is also some insights about the randomness of the auspices. <br /> I always ended up thinking about the auspice as something that can enhance a part of your personality, but without the &quot;total random&quot; option. Less invasive than apocalypse, is how you hunt. <br /> I like more the blood talon rahu who is not an unbeatable fighter but he is an absolute leader with crazy charisma and dominance skills. Same about the elodoth hunter in darkness who is a neck-breaker and antisocial but he is skilled in having a lot of spirit connection.<br /> <br /> If you know what I mean","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"color:#800000\">-'' </span>We are the unsullied.<br /> We are the inheritors.<br /> We are the Pure <span style=\"color:#800000\">''-</span>","edited":{"userid":3773,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3773-helur","user":"Helur","date":". 04-06-2022, 02:49 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3773-helur","name":"Helur","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3773_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"352"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-04-07T03:27:12-07:00","id":1478198,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Helur</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-forsaken/1478085-random-auspices?p=1478121#post1478121\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> So there is no &quot;official&quot; option about it?<br /> My questions came up when I read again wtf2. On every auspice chapter there is a little insight on how was that person before the change , the rahu almost always dominant and confrontational, the cahalith a passionate one and so on. But at the end of the book there is also some insights about the randomness of the auspices.<br /> I always ended up thinking about the auspice as something that can enhance a part of your personality, but without the &quot;total random&quot; option. Less invasive than apocalypse, is how you hunt.<br /> I like more the blood talon rahu who is not an unbeatable fighter but he is an absolute leader with crazy charisma and dominance skills. Same about the elodoth hunter in darkness who is a neck-breaker and antisocial but he is skilled in having a lot of spirit connection.<br /> <br /> If you know what I mean</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> As with a lot of things in CofD, I think the writers are just trying to avoid putting a straightjacket on character concepts. In-universe you can always chalk it up to the fact that Luna is the one who decides and she is a mad god. She's not totally random though, so she probably <i>usually</i> picks confrontational types to be Rahu, egotists to be Cahalith, and diplomats to be Elodoth but not always. Personally I like to go with the 50/50 rule when it comes to archetypes/stereotypes - basically 50 percent of characters should play into the stereotype, and 50 percent should play against it or subvert it in some way.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2384-aurumae","name":"Aurumae","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2384_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"191"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}